              <button id="reload-styles" type="button">Refresh styles / 更新風格清單</button>
              <p id="style-status" role="status"></p>
              <p>Lower distances mean closer features; compare each column separately.
                數值越小代表特徵越接近，請逐欄比較。TXT 的敘事 metadata 有限。
                <a href="/style-math.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formulas / 計算公式</a></p>
              <div class="style-table-scroll">
                <table aria-label="Style scores / 風格分數">
                  <thead><tr><th>風格 / Style</th><th>表層 / Surface</th><th>語法 / Grammar</th>
                    <th>節奏 / Rhythm</th><th>敘事 / Narrative</th><th>詞彙 / Lexical</th></tr></thead>
                  <tbody id="style-score-rows"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </section>
            <div class="character-strip">
              <h3>Main characters</h3>
              <ul id="character-list"></ul>
            </div>

            <div class="reader-body">
              <nav id="chapter-nav" class="chapter-nav" aria-label="Chapters"></nav>
              <div id="chapter-content" class="chapter-content"></div>
            </div>

            <details class="revision-details">
              <summary>Revision metadata</summary>
              <dl>
                <div><dt>Revision</dt><dd id="meta-revision"></dd></div>
                <div><dt>Updated</dt><dd id="meta-updated"></dd></div>
                <div><dt>Content hash</dt><dd id="meta-hash"></dd></div>
                <div><dt>Han text SHA-256</dt><dd id="meta-han-hash"></dd></div>
              </dl>
            </details>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="console-view" class="view console-view" aria-labelledby="console-heading" hidden>
      <div class="console-heading">
        <div>
          <h2 id="console-heading">API console</h2>
          <p class="muted">Direct requests to this StoryBlock instance</p>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-requests" aria-label="Quick requests">
          <button type="button" data-method="GET" data-path="/actuator/health">Health</button>
          <button type="button" data-method="GET" data-path="/v1/openapi.yaml">OpenAPI</button>
          <button type="button" data-method="GET" data-path="/v1/admin/novels">Novels</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="console-grid">
        <section class="request-panel" aria-labelledby="request-title">
          <h3 id="request-title">Request</h3>
          <div class="request-line">
            <select id="method" aria-label="HTTP method">
              <option>GET</option>
            </select>
